aktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:30.71,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Law...Dialogue: 50,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Law...Dialogue: 50,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Git...Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.45,0:00:11.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Law...Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.05,0:00:28.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim asıl ismim...Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar D. Water Law.Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İsmini mi sakladın?Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.98,0:00:37.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.48,0:00:41.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şaxırdım. Senin isminde de "D." var.Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Güvendiximden söyledim sana.Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.15,0:00:46.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Texekkür ederim.Dialogue: 50,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat ben de bilmiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy pek önemsemese de...Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,ben...Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.78,0:00:57.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,D'nin manasını çok merak ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kırmızı olanlar xart anlaxılan.Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.46,0:01:03.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,yle duruyor.Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.34,0:01:07.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yonkolar'ı yenmemiz gerek yani.Dialogue: 50,0:01:08.21,0:01:11.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize öylece vereceklerini zannetmiyorum çünkü.Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.09,0:01:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.51,0:01:17.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kırmızılardan lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.35,0:01:20.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir yerlerde D'li kixiler çaxrılıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.52,0:01:23.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Tanrıların Ezeli Düxmanları!"Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.41,0:01:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cora-san...Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.62,0:01:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kusura bakma...Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.50,0:01:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama bu inixli çıkıxlı kaderin manasını...Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.62,0:01:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,öxrenmek istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.31,0:03:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, iyi misin?Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.94,0:03:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim siniyursun beni?Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Masil iyi oliyim?Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.23,0:03:34.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi durumda olamazsın tabii.Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.07,0:03:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse ki ben iyi durumdayım.Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Otama. Buraya nasıl geldin?Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxman gemisine bindik.Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Düxmanın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay! Şu köpexi parça pinçik et!Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.67,0:03:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen yapsana.Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüküreyim! Ne ix bu babun?Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.52,0:04:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu nereden çıktı ya?Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hihimaru!Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.77,0:04:13.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları 3 dakika oyala.Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.78,0:04:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar çok tehlikelidir. O dev maymuna zarar verirler.Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi küçük görme, Onami-chan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya...Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,samuray olarak geldik!Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Açın yolu!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.49,0:05:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ixin sonu yok, Genç Efendi Yamato.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.33,0:05:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle desem de zırhlı birliximi kaybetmek istemem.Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.79,0:05:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tonla adamımı haxat ettiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nixan al!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atex!Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun! Shinobu-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato...Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.54,0:05:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar mermi yersen...Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.67,0:05:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir xey olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.22,0:06:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exer samuraysan yapılması gerekeni yap!Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.01,0:06:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni arkada bırakıp efendimi buradan...Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.18,0:06:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.27,0:06:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden...Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.77,0:06:21.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden...Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.78,0:06:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,böyle bir xey yapmazdı!Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar inatçı...Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.34,0:06:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feci güçlü olsanız da o iki ezixi korurken beni alt edebilecexinizi sanıyorsanız...Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.80,0:06:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hayal görüyorsunuz derim, Genç Efendi Yamato.Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.02,0:06:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sasaki...Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.63,0:07:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.59,0:07:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ekilin, çekilin!Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.18,0:07:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ekilin yoldan!Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franosuke!Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Momo?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.40,0:07:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayattasın, ne güzel. Shinobu, sen de iyi durumdasın di' mi?Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.65,0:07:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanıyorum seni! Luffy'nin tayfasından...Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.41,0:07:56.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayborg Franky! Kelle dülü 94 milyon beli.Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekmix!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haccha?! Ne arıyorsun burada?Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.31,0:08:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum sakat!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma, aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.82,0:08:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalayamadın diye sinirlendin mi? !ocuk musun sen?Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.09,0:08:47.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zırhlı Birlik, onları gözden kaybetmeyin! Kaçmalarına izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yer çöktü.Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Axaxıya gidebiliriz sahi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.73,0:09:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun! Shinobu-san! Bu yolla axaxıya kaçalım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.74,0:09:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo! Shinobu! İyi misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.45,0:09:12.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi yakaladı mı?Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.95,0:09:16.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, bize yardım ediyor.Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.12,0:09:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayborg Franky, burasını halledersin.Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.79,0:09:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.92,0:09:26.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, bu ikisini bana emanet etti.Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.75,0:09:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimsin bilmiyorum ama...Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.34,0:09:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tamam! Süper güvenebilirsin bana!Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.01,0:09:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-san, Momonosuke-kun'u tut!Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.06,0:09:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyilik borcumu ödeyeyim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.06,0:09:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen geliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.35,0:09:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bari xu herifi indireyim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.57,0:09:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ınlayan Ok!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.97,0:10:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halloldu.Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O mu yaptı bunu?Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim ki o?Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haccha?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siktir!Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.57,0:10:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato, Momonosuke'yi alıp axaxıya kaçtı!Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.45,0:10:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takip ekibi kurun! Derhal pexlerine düxün!Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.17,0:10:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zırhlı Birlik, biz xu hurda yıxınını parçalayacaxız.Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.15,0:11:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.23,0:11:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen hayatta kalmalısın!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.57,0:11:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mutlaka hayatta kalmalısın.Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.20,0:11:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyayı yeni xafaxa taxıyacak olan...Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sensin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.45,0:11:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.46,0:11:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canımı sıkıyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.11,0:11:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaderiniz çoktan mühürlendi, sizi zavallılar!Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.93,0:12:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom geri döndü!Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.11,0:12:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endixelenmeyin. Tek derdim,Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun olduxu yere çıkmak.Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.97,0:13:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Virüsle mücadele etme yolunu buldum!Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.27,0:13:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahiden mi?Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç, Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.11,0:13:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gösteri hemen bitmesin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Omasa!Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.33,0:13:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kendine gel!Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.42,0:13:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O axamaya geldik mi?Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.38,0:13:43.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır! Buraya kadar gelmixtim!Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada ölmek istemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım et!Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ peximde.Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.14,0:14:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yok böyle bir inat!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.15,0:14:43.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Antikoru ver.Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake piçi!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geldin mi? Yardım et!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.71,0:15:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'apıyorsun? Onunla birlikte dövüxmemiz gerek.Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.76,0:15:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siktir!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.85,0:15:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkiye bir hiç adil dexil ixte!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.77,0:15:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benimle teke tek kapıxmak istiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.81,0:15:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanılıyor muyum?Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.44,0:15:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu anlayıxlılık nereden çıktı bilmiyorum ama var gücünle saldır bakalım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.78,0:15:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, öyleyse... Kulak ver!Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.12,0:15:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sax ol.Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.57,0:16:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu katı sana bıraksam ya?Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oyun oynayacak vaktim yok.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.29,0:16:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lmezsin di' mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.50,0:16:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette.Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.75,0:16:19.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Virüsün nasıl ixledixini çözdüm.Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helal sana.Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.11,0:16:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaledeki tüm metali toplayacak mısın...Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.95,0:16:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.12,0:16:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Eustass "Kaptan" Kid?Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.17,0:17:03.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durdurun xunu! !atıya çıkmasın!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geliyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.00,0:17:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kodum mu oturtan yıxınla karxılarım ben de!Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.89,0:17:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizimle gelmek isteyen yoldan çekilmesin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.24,0:17:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeterli olur mu sence Killer?Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.96,0:17:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxmanımız dünyanın en güçlü korsanı.Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.29,0:17:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar çok, o kadar iyi.Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.13,0:17:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen!Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'yı durdurun!Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.94,0:18:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçıncı kattayız?Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kattan sonra üçüncü kat var.Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!atı da bexinci katın üstünde.Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ! Kin'emon, bekle beni!Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.58,0:18:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Duydunuz mu?Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Neyi?Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.75,0:18:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz... Sçüncü kattan bir ses geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.00,0:18:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naz yapma kız!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'olur yapmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.76,0:18:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dayanamıyorum artık!Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.56,0:18:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapmamalısınız!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.77,0:18:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.99,0:18:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle bizi, Kin'emon!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!atı katı ne tarafta?Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.33,0:19:01.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu tarafta!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.33,0:19:02.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.34,0:19:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naz yapma kız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.46,0:19:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapmamalısınız! Yapmamalısınız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nemli bir ixim çıktı.Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz önden gidin.Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxim biter bitmez size yetixirim!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.19,0:19:29.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Duyuyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.61,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.61,0:19:32.94,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Güzel bir kadın...Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,yardım çaxırıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.74,0:19:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel xöyle yanacıma!Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.87,0:19:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'olur yapmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.71,0:19:52.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Axk kuxum, gel hele xöyle.Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.38,0:19:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel kız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.97,0:20:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel kız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen durun artık!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.43,0:20:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.02,0:20:10.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuray ülkesinin cinsel taciz replikleri.Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel kız ve çok ayıp.Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.61,0:20:21.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nüfuz sahibi biri, çaresiz bir kadının kimonusunu çözüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.37,0:20:27.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dönen kadının her dönüxte yalnızca elbisesi elden gitmiyor...Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.54,0:20:29.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,iffeti de gidiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yettim! Yardımına geldim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.51,0:20:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel...Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.59,0:20:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelmeyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.77,0:20:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Bu ne?Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.77,0:20:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,rümcek axı mı?Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.15,0:20:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kesin xunu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.65,0:21:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok ayıp!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.16,0:21:07.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Edepsiz Tuzak!  Edepsiz Tuzak!Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.35,0:21:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahlak bekçisi bir sapık daha geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.35,0:21:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüküreyim. Tuzak mıymıx?Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.98,0:21:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'dan Kara Bacak Sanji.Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.19,0:21:38.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kelle ödülü 330 milyon beli.Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.07,0:21:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkadaxı Zoro'yla yarıxıyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.86,0:21:43.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun ödülü daha yüksekti galiba.Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harika! Turnayı gözünden vurmuxuz.Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.08,0:21:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen çözün beni! Affederim sizi.Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.33,0:21:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay çok korkutucu. Bize xantaj yapıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmem gereken bir yer var!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.17,0:22:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin gitmenle savax daha da büyür.Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.68,0:22:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ziyafet salonu da nasibini almasın, sax ol.Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.89,0:22:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dostlarım beni bekliyor! !özün artık xu ipleri!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.98,0:22:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arsız bir çocuksun bakıyorum da. İçim gıcıklandı.Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ocuk mu? Dalga geçme benimle!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.44,0:22:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak ne diyecexim.Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.57,0:22:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni...Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seviyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.20,0:22:32.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama! Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seni...Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.55,0:22:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seviyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.05,0:22:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gorishiro! Muz atıp durma artık!Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poker-sama, Hasır Şapka ve Jinbe o tarafa doxru geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.81,0:22:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, güzel.Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.61,0:22:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maalesef Kid'e engel olamadım...Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.11,0:23:05.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bak, Hasır Şapka'nın ödülü 1,5 milyar beli.Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.16,0:23:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu haklarsam hatamı telafi eder, üstüne ödül bile alırım.Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.29,0:23:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeter artık ya!Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.33,0:23:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo'ya girmek... Fena olmaz ha.Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.25,0:23:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-san! Hasır Şapka-san!Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.67,0:23:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buradan!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.88,0:23:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim bunlar?Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.38,0:23:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo, siz miydiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.05,0:23:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'daki adamlar!Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.64,0:23:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hasır Şapka daha gelmedi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.51,0:23:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakında orada olur.Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.60,0:23:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,El merdiveni...Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.85,0:23:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bununla 4. kata geçebilirsiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.65,0:23:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basamaklı merdivenlerde düxman pusmux.Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.36,0:23:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok yardımı dokunur. Sax olun.Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.41,0:23:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelmeyecek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.71,0:23:59.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni dinleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.79,0:24:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz xeytanına karxı atex kullanın!Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.46,0:24:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu virüs, vücutlarımızı donduran gazla birlextirilmix!Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.01,0:24:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Donmanızı engellerseniz virüs çoxalmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.23,0:24:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkese yetecek antikor üretecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.65,0:24:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben doktorum! Dost düxman demeden herkesi kurtaracaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.49,0:24:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ne?!  Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.45,0:24:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkesi mi? Omasa'yı da mı?Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.66,0:24:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kalmaya bakın! O axaxılık adam yüzünden canınızdan olmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.42,0:24:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Axzın iyi laf yapıyor, tanuki.Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.88,0:24:52.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir de sana bakalım, Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.05,0:24:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mis gibi oyundu anasını satayım.Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.18,0:24:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oyunumun içine edersiniz ha!Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.44,0:25:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz ikiniz sinirimi bozuyorsunuz!Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.11,0:25:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxlatma oyununa!Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.57,0:25:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.45,0:25:19.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle sıkıcı bir oyunu oynamaya gelmedim bu adaya!Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.87,0:25:22.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın en güçlüsü denilen Kaido'yu...Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.54,0:25:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,devirmeye geldim!Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.64,0:25:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.47,0:25:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,fkesi deprem mi yarattı?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.39,0:25:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haki mi? Kralın hakisi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.73,0:25:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tutunun bir yerlere, dayanın millet!Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.49,0:25:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro-san, ne yaptın öyle? Korkulası birisin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.62,0:25:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benimle ne alakası var bunun?Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.46,0:26:06.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sarsıntı da ne?Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.59,0:26:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkuyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.84,0:26:11.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, korkmuyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.76,0:26:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir xey olmayacak sana. Daha hızlı gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.43,0:26:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha hızlı!Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.19,0:26:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne?! Deprem mi Jinbe?Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.94,0:26:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ada jeolojik olarak çok ender bir bölgede.Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.00,0:26:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olacak gibi dexil! Kıyıya gidemiyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.50,0:26:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'dan ximdilik uzaklaxın!Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.14,0:27:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne...Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.10,0:27:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabırsızlıxı üstünde.Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.90,0:27:15.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ada batıyor mu yoksa?Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.39,0:27:41.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'ya... ne oluyor be?Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.10,0:27:44.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptana bir xey olmaz umarım.Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.95,0:27:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun, senin hayatta kalman birinci önceliximiz.Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.07,0:28:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiye binip adadan ayrılalım!Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.95,0:28:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele etmemiz gerek.Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.58,0:28:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçimde kötü bir his var!Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.26,0:28:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu neydi ximdi?Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.22,0:28:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sarsıntı durdu.Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.93,0:28:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum Zoro, ben de gördüm.Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.56,0:28:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okiku-chan'ın kolu!Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.82,0:28:35.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de gördüm.Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.82,0:28:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxını kaçırdım.Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.82,0:28:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oraya uçabilsem kexke.Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.78,0:28:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her yol ayrı bir savax ama.Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.47,0:29:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar!Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.06,0:29:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anka Kuxu Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.68,0:29:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ta kendisi.Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.73,0:29:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ana birlik dexil misiniz siz? Hâlâ bu katta ne oyalanıyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.15,0:29:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de keyfimizden burada durmuyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.28,0:29:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapabilecexim bir xey var mı?Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.04,0:29:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canavar Korsanları'nın gemisi ortada yok.Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.62,0:29:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.02,0:29:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz de yok!Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.23,0:29:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Ne demek istiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.90,0:29:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geç kaldık.Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.86,0:29:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denize kaçamayız artık!Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.78,0:30:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası liman dexil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.07,0:30:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deminki sarsıntı...Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.70,0:30:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi anladım.Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.45,0:30:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oluyor desene Yamato?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.25,0:30:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ejderhalar oluxturdukları alev bulutlarıyla havada uçar.Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.34,0:30:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani xu an...Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.65,0:30:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido, Onigashima'yı uçuruyor!Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.91,0:30:49.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adayı !içek Baxkenti'ne indirecek!Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.04,0:30:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yok artık.Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.21,0:31:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatmin oldunuz mu?Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.58,0:31:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki'nin ixi bitti.Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.67,0:31:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano, daha doxrusu Yeni Onigashima,Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.17,0:31:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,korsanların kalesi olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.52,0:32:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kargaxa dolu dünyayı baxlatalım!Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.61,0:03:41.37,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Alev BulutlarıDialogue: 1,0:03:38.61,0:03:41.37,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Alev BulutlarıDialogue: 9,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.92,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,İkinci Bodrum KatıDialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.92,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,m 1515.4 448.2 l 1498.3 448 1492.06 433.59 1483.49 421.13 1472.8 408.22 1463.37 399.53 1445.3 384.9 1447.5 119.7 1456.5 116.42 1465.61 111.64 1477.51 101.06 1487.67 90.11 1494.56 80.74 1500.3 67.3 1765.21 66.64 1782.09 66.97 1788.9 68.13 1791.54 75.44 1796.5 85.28 1808.4 103.8 1820.86 115.67 1829.62 120.51 1836.24 122.91 1837.95 124.99 1838.93 161.38 1840.1 361.32 1841.24 389.09 1825.66 398.49 1810.59 411.35 1797.17 427.95 1791.93 442.78 1790 446.4 1789.05 446.7 1771.82 447.32 1673.84 447.06 1515.4 448.2Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.92,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,m 1515.4 448.2 l 1498.3 448 1492.06 433.59 1483.49 421.13 1472.8 408.22 1463.37 399.53 1445.3 384.9 1447.5 119.7 1456.5 116.42 1465.61 111.64 1477.51 101.06 1487.67 90.11 1494.56 80.74 1500.3 67.3 1765.21 66.64 1782.09 66.97 1788.9 68.13 1791.54 75.44 1796.5 85.28 1808.4 103.8 1820.86 115.67 1829.62 120.51 1836.24 122.91 1837.95 124.99 1838.93 161.38 1840.1 361.32 1841.24 389.09 1825.66 398.49 1810.59 411.35 1797.17 427.95 1791.93 442.78 1790 446.4 1789.05 446.7 1771.82 447.32 1673.84 447.06 1515.4 448.2 m 1531.4 444.9 l 1532 441.5 1534.12 439.66 1539.8 441.1 1544.56 443.73 1546.68 442.16 1549.38 443.78 1551.38 442.22 1552.79 443.95 1553.32 441.78 1554.26 441.36 1559.29 441.19 1560.48 438.07 1563.75 439.59 1562 441 1562.54 441.78 1564.43 441.8 1567.63 439.34 1568.67 436.6 1570 435.5 1571.81 437.51 1570.44 440.86 1573.7 441.42 1576.1 443 1576.96 441.4 1575.16 439.17 1